[{"id":"502","date":"2026-11-14T07:18:26+00:00","text":"Triple digits 💯 Electron has reached 100 launches faster than any commercially developed rocket in history. With another 100+ launches in backlog, we're just getting started.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/lVefVtd9wRZ7EQ5oVfH8Ye7GPrpB9bvdWO3AoUg_yGnu5kqJM0TOFvxF97zU6_8UDB4LMW3VwKXtB55xxqHaTgMHuwWLUrxov85Z0_SJhXEDFNZqLynPdL3AZBopToaJk6ZZgns2URXuezhndQXr_4uTltQfnc_5hZ92n8E-O4LzqRr8Sg5OnTCFKu0rbg1SGnw98AL2eI70a7vRCpAI6BmcC95Wo_A1X2M3tceHQxKxwFo51ZiymTFq9KGpXKOJCHpXy9-qBkSMGQLbhWSX1ov_rb-VN1kgZi7xmdfbnLPVNN-gLep-027n53R3JUsTMCq5s6pn6M3E1QVZnsqgFA","video":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/ea67052d3e.mp4?token=ESgGhii6D3h72E9P0V9Wk2UhwZpzt8Tjjb76zUVXYRPrmoQNS8FTH_QYLB7n2XqViJVGDOtgCIQ1mriylCiJjEVRl7sOKsvjl8AEaZGl3NlNvYAPJ0QwZowALHYEPyOePXkPQXK7vQmZln4BRvZuJ99dZSmZjD3vLnirtlsf34YLnmF5bbhb_96levG_ln9tyblHWRcAHXF6enYmRsp3ShcoE415bjGCls232Fnl-95zQjn2MTXuzvYjd-ogW4AiDpo10yrIAu91yZHAadBw8vhkYPtPZq826rYVzOLSOcbHSGVxqxnzPs2kJZxZDL3wjNqQ5JFJleyci28C-FVxaw","hasVideo":true},{"id":"501","date":"2026-11-14T06:34:10+00:00","text":"From Flight 1 to 100, our Founder and CEO peter j beck has had many memorable moments in nearly a decade of launches. \"It is super hard and the team just does an amazing, amazing job.\" Electron opened access to space, but 100 launches is just the start. There's 55+ Rocket Lab spacecraft in development and production, multiple missions operating on orbit today, and $1b+ worth of launches booked across all three of our rocket programs - Electron, HASTE and Neutron. We're delivering spacecraft and components to the Moon, Mars, and intend to operate our own constellation and space services for millions of people on Earth. \"It's the grand master plan playing out.\"","image":"","video":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/6c1a243297.mp4?token=hJUTr6Z2oxqKY8y_ZTH8tllRKFCwOl8mT4G1Qp-BSfTWd-THFGkWXIrtyx8-AYKCsPwJESSwiSCqLDqfKOqr5ZarroSxOQCjjMDWbgYSzXb9Van4WUfPvhUDP4PChINEdnmv9Tdulf86D1mYLhGq0cGvfRj3p0q6DC2Wx83A