rford engines (one less than 1000 because we re-flew a recovered engine on our 40th launch). Here's more Electron facts and figures from Julian Spice LIVE at Range Control. 👇","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"493","date":"2026-11-14T05:00:57+00:00","text":"Black, white and GOLD. LOx fueling is underway on our 100th Electron rocket, which got a special paint job for this golden milestone. We are T-35 minutes away from lift-off.","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"492","date":"2026-11-14T04:44:47+00:00","text":"Join us LIVE for Electron's 100th launch: \"The Mountain God Rises\" for QPS Inc https://t.co/4egLEY1mlS","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"491","date":"2026-11-14T04:36:44+00:00","text":"SPB clocking in for Launch 100 with the best views of LC-1.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/ol5J_5NjcgW1_LDa5ID1F9k4SXOgPSgmgP4Q0Mnbl6GpazbL9eyJj0-dc4_JJ0N7cPVqQ2aTaEDmhRwo0xhdPAabehqspWBmHM6Du_d3mL-JqXyrYKrBdCymAZJuhc5f3i3ACEDMRR5wOGuFIduvzq9FzGk-qiz8elEppdnBiDgP41vbx0rVCbrV9m_POtjwhvqTIS2Buk2RQt72XIdM4lqsof7Oab0HZUqpnpVvX0IQAnxfE5NTamPBfLzj2hWfmCWKYN1Xk-nya7puQyFDRGvPptTjutH6Wi-PPKvATEI_y3wLpUjYxERmgtSH23VMmDmB1NzE8kOhyVrX676kGA","video":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/3911032852.mp4?token=YitDbZ-xVaXagYs4KazUHv2AmOlhamiKf-ex6cV98vUt-a8YHjgLvlcu4sU5iYOtbSZdzu7D1LvcrW_EQKf980t-i52aUADv_At1QI-_IXbhkttGTriBcQcb3s-GXrSm3Ge289dce0-Yg3V9bOyx1MyjHAyaJ7eGPJPXauV6W28CD38dXEroIl1kxD7w6dJdq68XxTV1UuG54jlYuwQNpQOxsDk-mSfPSyuCkeHnHkjTCkA-qwNyiC1L_PFf70KPs6Hzf0ERKFbRebq_s_8PK7ysPjOSm3JBk_3hXGfV9CHfZHY66Wd-LdDJPzE3W0g9wMZzOi7ez4Tz2DSbtrqKPw","hasVideo":true},{"id":"490","date":"2026-11-14T04:30:37+00:00","text":"Team snap 📸 Our customer for our 100th mission QPS Inc is on-site at LC-1. A front row seat for their 11th ride to space on Electron.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/e9h72mH9VtMUlnJDx548WcE7NzXCgZbogE8UoE0J8z_Ro59Gi-6o-Sb7xC7pAtZJlBgIvC3JX9yR7pl1BJRSepCY5hCVDg56xpWSu59vzGyc7SCDVNdm5YfXQYB41Hz_StAVeZMa3BCUOihAalRGAfAoAO3z0OF5VMIOxtI