e it all started for Electron - a country with no space heritage. Today, Rocket Lab is a global space company with teams across the United States, Canada, Europe and New Zealand. We're about to launch our 100th rocket.","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"482","date":"2026-11-13T19:25:54+00:00","text":"To launch a lot of rockets, you need to build a lot of rockets. Our factory is currently producing Electron at a rate of one rocket every 8 days. From single layers of carbon composite, to firing 3D-printed Rutherford engines multiple times before flight - every step requires precision and paranoia. This is Electron's journey from production to the pad.","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"481","date":"2026-11-13T17:41:01+00:00","text":"Our 100th launch window opens in 12 hours. Join us LIVE for a special broadcast to celebrate this milestone from 04:30 UTC, Saturday November 14th - approximately one hour before lift-off. https://t.co/NGrGy4AhRB","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"480","date":"2026-11-12T23:37:54+00:00","text":"All eight Rocket Lab-built Lightning platforms for MDA space and Globalstar have passed initial on-orbit functional tests. Orbit raising is now underway, with our team supporting the spacecraft as they climb toward their final orbit.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/ddJR9wnbLk6ax3PVKDCShEsxxfwn3yxQ5eC5rBBgruNik6snUhgW5p4_hWZlICep0w263pqZuloO7AW3Uhtohbfv7RdTFJ2nVU-c_GqqISwXGJhjsNvBs2x6HHfUkC202RLwd3iaa3QjJUMVq1336eETu4fBWp1cSgyWBDFfJnCMHH6mO4ssMJ2WLr3NJH2AUaA-YAABE8M6gzC8vs8_Vf282wi-tGOMJQIkefi3s7cDfPLj2NKdTOu8sS3bZZhbvfBTZtF8BDHjAoCI54DJfr44pCdbfLppuiun-48bJzwqguKL_QkLnEtmVDPZhjrdKKVpi7gwL_uRzYUHh0lHaQ.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"479","date":"2026-11-12T22:35:36+00:00","text":"Wet Dress Rehearsal complete ✅ Electron is ready for its 100th launch this weekend from Launch Complex 1. 'The Mountain God Rises' launch window opens tomorrow Nov 14: 🚀 6:30pm NZDT 🚀 2:30 pm JST 🚀 05:30 UTC 🚀 12:30 am 